id: infinite-energy
name: Infinite Energy
order: 1
optionOf: energy-core
optionEffect: 4
description: >
  Regain 4(bT) Ki Points.
text: >
  Infinite Energy [Triggered/Start of Combat Round]: Regain 4(bT) Ki Points.

---

# (4) At the start of every Combat Round. Automatic by default; set Triggered, chosen on the Round's card.
[triggered/start-of-round, effect 4]
ki.value += 4(bT);

# (5) "As a Standard Action with an Action Cost of 1 Action, you may use a Ki Surge" - a Maneuver of its own,
# maneuvers/energy-core-fifth-effect.dbu, in the list while this Option is had.
